## 9. Quick reference

```bash
# what CI runs
mvn -T 8 clean verify --no-transfer-progress -B -V

# fast single-module check (includes checkstyle)
mvn -pl <module> -am -DskipTests verify

# after touching any pom.xml
mvn sortpom:sort

# read the history behind a rule in §4
git log --grep RANGER-5115 -p
```

